{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"nginx","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Nginx config","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nginx config (.nginx .nginxconf).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"nginx","name":"Nginx config","extensions":[".nginx",".nginxconf"],"grammar":"grammars/nginx.json","filenames":["nginx.conf","mime.types"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Nginx config","path":"snippets/nginx.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/nginx.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*[a-z_0-9]+(?=\\\\s)\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:ssl_certificate_key|proxy_set_header|worker_processes|ssl_certificate|fastcgi_pass|server_name|proxy_pass|error_page|add_header|access_log|try_files|error_log|location|upstream|rewrite|include|server|events|return|listen|index|http|root|gzip|map|set|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:off|on)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/nginx.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Server block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"server\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"server {\",\n      \"\\tlisten 80;\",\n      \"\\tserver_name ${1:example.com};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\tlocation / {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A server block\"\n  },\n  \"Reverse proxy\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proxy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"location ${1:/} {\",\n      \"\\tproxy_pass http://${2:127.0.0.1:3000};\",\n      \"\\tproxy_set_header Host \\\\$host;\",\n      \"\\tproxy_set_header X-Real-IP \\\\$remote_addr;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A reverse proxy location\"\n  },\n  \"PHP-FPM\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"php\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"location ~ \\\\\\\\.php\\\\$ {\",\n      \"\\tfastcgi_pass unix:/run/php/php-fpm.sock;\",\n      \"\\tinclude fastcgi_params;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A PHP location\"\n  },\n  \"SSL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ssl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"listen 443 ssl http2;\",\n      \"ssl_certificate ${1:/etc/ssl/cert.pem};\",\n      \"ssl_certificate_key ${2:/etc/ssl/key.pem};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"TLS settings\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Nginx config\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Nginx config.\n\n## Files\n\n`.nginx`, `.nginxconf`, `nginx.conf`, `mime.types`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `server` | A server block |\n| `proxy` | A reverse proxy location |\n| `php` | A PHP location |\n| `ssl` | TLS settings |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}